@504 = ~When wholly consumed, this potion restores 60 Hit Points to the person. The effect is instantaneous, and the potion is destroyed in the process.~
@505 = ~Potion de  force de géant des collines*~
@506 = ~Anyone who drinks a giant strength potion gains superhuman strength and bonuses to hit and damage when using a melee or ranged weapon. The potion's effect lasts for 2 hours.

