@5073 = ~Tokkètel's Black Beverage~
@5074 = ~This acrid beverage with a foul odor conceals a strange power: anyone who drinks it is covered by a shield of negative energy. 

STATISTICS:

Camouflage: +30 to Stealth and +2 to AC.
Any creature that strikes the drinker and is within range must succeed on a saving throw against spells or lose one level.
Protection against the Negative plane.

Duration: 5 turns.

Weight: 1~
