STATISTICS:

Cold Resistance +125%
Blue Fire Shield
Cold Aura
Cold Melee Attacks
Duration: 2 turns

Weight: 1~

@50119 = ~Potion of supreme warrior~
@50120 = ~This potion allows the drinker to acquire instinctive knowledge of combat as if they were an experienced fighter.

STATISTICS:

+1 attack per round
TAC0 +10
Critical hit chance +1
Damage +2
Duration: 10 turns

Weight: 1~
@50121 = ~Potion of Caustic Breath~
@50122 = ~This potion, whose heart never stops burning, allows its drinker to breathe acid onto a cone-shaped area in front of them at will each round.

STATISTICS:

Damage: 10D6 points of acid damage (save vs blow for ½)
Area: 80° cone 1,5 foot long in front of him.

Duration: 2 turns

Weight: 1~
