@50129 = ~Essence of Death~
@50130 = ~This oil, when applied to a melee weapon, makes it deadly.

STATISTICS:

Melee strikes kill the target if it has 10 Hit Dice or less. If it has more than 10 HD, it dies if it fails a saving throw against death.

Duration: 3 turns

