Weight: 1~
@50153 = ~Pyrophorite Oil~
@50154 = ~This oil ignites shortly after being applied. When used on a melee weapon, it adds fire damage to its base damage. On a ranged weapon, the effect lasts only a few seconds, as the oil flies off with the projectile.

